st: `git diff --stat internal/prompt/templates/`（预期无 diff）. So `internal/prompt/templates/` still exists and should be unchanged.\n\nAnd \"新增 `xxxxbuilder.go` 定义 `RuntimeBuilder` 接口\" - so `xxxxbuilder.go` is a file, likely in `internal/builder` package.\n\nLet me check the task's tasks.json to understand the exact expected structure and whether there are more details."}}
